# --- The old site: excluded wholesale ------------------------------------
# Archive/ holds the backup of the old WordPress site: roughly 600 MB of image
# material whose usage rights are undocumented, and the full database export,
# which contained third parties' personal data.
#
# Neither belongs in a public repository — and release assets of a public
# repository are public too, so uploading it to one is not a way round this.
#
# The exclusion is deliberately blanket: one rule, rather than a per-file
# judgement about what is safe to add. CLAUDE.md states that rule and forbids
# weakening it with exceptions; this comment records why it is written that way.
#
# Excluding it costs nothing, and that is the point. Every text of the old site
# is extracted to docs/content/ and versioned there by
# tools/extract-wp-content.mjs, so the record survives without the 600 MB. The
# image material is archived outside the repository — the owner's
# responsibility, deliberately not this repository's. This repository is
# therefore not a backup of the old site.
Archive/

# --- Operating system ----------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Editor / IDE --------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

